WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:05.980
Toys. They are miraculous buds that swell from the hearts of the chosen.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.490
Some flowers are born pure, while others bloom laced with poison.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.410
The Age of Detectives.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:18.660
The two flowers, vying for beauty.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:24.460
Their names are the Detective and the Phantom Thief.

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:08.480
It's now time to combine our Toys...

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:09.430
...into one!

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:12.650
Ninja Toys Art: Phoenix!

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:31.100
I caught a cold...

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:37.450
Here, ice. Even though I didn't wanna do this. So just take it.

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:39.480
Thank you very much...

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:46.980
Sheesh. Losing their Toys wasn't good enough for them, so they just had to get sick too.

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:51.900
They're a real handful. Even though they went in the sea and made a big fuss over getting their Toys back,

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:53.560
it disappeared again anyways!

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:54.890
Eh? I see.

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:57.030
Could you even find a more useless group than them?

00:02:57.970 --> 00:03:00.900
Be thankful that you were at least able to get some ice.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:04.130
You can also be thankful for my beauty!

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:11.370
C... C... Cold! So cold!

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:14.460
Hot.... So hot...

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:19.260
I can see a flowerbed!

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:21.510
Hot...

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:27.030
Ow...

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:28.200
Hot...

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:29.650
Flowerbed!

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:31.420
So cold...

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:37.570
Those retards caught colds and are now bedridden!

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:41.500
No one's there to care for them, so they're probably crying their heads off!

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:45.320
Why did Milky Holmes catch colds?

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:49.680
It's Kokoro's fault. Sherlock came to her for advice the other day.

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:50.690
Advice?

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:53.170
Probably on how to get back their Toys.

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:56.720
I recorded those events on here.

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:57.970
How convenient!

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:04.020
Ah! Too bright, Kokoro-chan!

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:05.760
Don't call me that!

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:09.190
But you know, Sherlock Shellingford...

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:15.540
I compliment you for coming to me, Akechi Kokoro, genius graduate of Harvard with an IQ of 130,000,

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:18.270
for advice on how to get your Toys back!

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:20.260
Ooh, I got praised!

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.960
<i>Now then, how shall I play with you?</i>

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:25.990
These retards are like moths to a flame in summer!

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:26.950
<i>Summer!</i>

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.290
Summer means shaved ice!

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.230
<i>Yes, that's right.</i>

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:33.410
First!

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:36.570
Eat a heap of shaved ice in one go!

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:39.420
If you do that, you'll get a brain freeze, causing it to change,

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:41.260
which'll bring your Toys back!

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:43.220
I see! You're great!

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:46.490
I'll call everyone right away! Thanks, Kokoro-chan!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:48.440
Don't call me that!

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.310
Itadakimasu!

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:57.440
My head!

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:59.920
Ahh, our Toys didn't come back, Kokoro-chan!

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:01.570
Don't call me that!

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:07.950
May our Toys come back... May our Toys come back!

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:09.870
If that doesn't work...

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:17.000
May our Toys come back... May our Toys come back!

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:21.670
Like that.

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:22.700
That's mean...

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:26.520
Even though they've been fooled before, they're still as soft-hearted as ever...

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:30.810
Even with the saying "idiots don't catch colds," those retards really went all-out in catching it!

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:33.680
They're so stupid that the cold caught <i>them</i> instead!

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.580
Ahh, she's so annoying...

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.340
I'd like you to calm down now.

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:39.410
Any compassion she has left is rotting away.

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.440
Let's pay them a visit later!

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.110
Visit?

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:42.570
Yup!

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:45.610
They must be at their limit with no one to care for them!

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:48.670
Not that anyone gives a damn, anyways!

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:51.830
I'll make it so that they'll never be able to catch up to my greatness!

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:53.710
She's like the villain now...

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:55.330
She needs some divine punishment.

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:08.360
Help...

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:09.500
Hot...

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.540
The flowers...

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:12.220
Hurt...

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:15.120
Kokoro-san played around with them, which gave them colds,

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:17.580
and no one is caring for them...

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:19.490
I suppose I don't have a choice.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:21.440
I'll take them in my care.

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:27.110
So hungry...

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:27.880
Open up.

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:35.970
My body... hurts...

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:37.780
Sleep on the bed properly.

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:40.770
There, there.

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:50.740
They really are such foolish kids.

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:57.520
However, they haven't forgotten the feeling of wanting to get their Toys back.

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:00.600
I compliment them for doing at least that much.

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:03.550
Sherlock, here's some medicine.

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:07.430
Bitter!

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:08.820
You've got to drink it!

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:29.840
Why is Henriette-sama taking care of Milky Holmes?

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:32.170
Just leave that bunch alone...

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:36.760
The benevolent Henriette-sama does not forsake the weak, be they friend or foe.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:39.480
Yes!

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:41.960
Just like Maria-sama.

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:44.730
No, it is just like Henriette-sama!

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:59.890
My cold is gone! I feel refreshed!

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:01.310
Ahh, I feel great!

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:02.940
Invigorating!

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:05.390
My body feels light!

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.710
Ah, Kamaboko's all better too!

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:09.720
Yeah!

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:11.730
Ah, Henriette-san?

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:17.080
Did Henriette-sama just...

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:18.530
...take care of us?

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:19.830
Throughout the night?

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:22.230
She's so kind...

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:26.020
Ah, morning.

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:28.890
I see you've taken care of us!

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:30.870
We're all better now thanks to you!

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:34.860
We'll work hard again today to get back our Toys!

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:38.030
Yes, best of luck...

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.160
Henriette-san?!

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:56.470
She caught our colds, huh...

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:59.090
It's our turn to take care of her!

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:01.430
Yeah! I'll give her all the nursing she can get!

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:07.520
How dare they give Henriette-sama their colds!

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:10.080
Ahh, it is unforgivable!

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.900
Even though we've always been at her side and taking care of her!

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:18.150
But I suppose we aren't really allowed in taking care of her, huh?

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:22.410
Wiping down her body, changing out her sweaty pajamas...

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:28.080
Isn't it fine?

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:29.930
You guys can get out now!

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:31.630
We'll take care of her!

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:32.920
Get out!

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:37.600
Don't just go barging in a girl's room!

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:39.150
Yeah! It's rude, you know!

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:40.830
I don't wanna hear that from you!

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:42.130
Let's get out for now.

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:55.610
Henriette-san, don't worry! We'll take good care of you!

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:59.290
And in order to do that, we need to replace her towel first!

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:01.350
I'll do that!

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:02.520
Leave it to me!

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:03.290
I will!

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:07.040
Goal!!

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:11.960
Ah, this is...!

00:10:14.910 --> 00:10:16.630
What an amazing elasticity!

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:18.180
I gotta change her towel!

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:19.580
Excuse me!

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:23.260
Oh, it's warm...

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.390
Please get better soon.

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:32.090
She's really sweating a lot...

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:34.360
Shouldn't we change her clothes now?

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:35.760
Change...

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:37.460
Is this her closet?

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:41.030
She has so many clothes...

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:41.820
Huh?

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:44.160
There's something stuck here...

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:46.590
I can't get it out...

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:49.600
Hey, it doesn't have to be fancy! Come on!

00:10:51.780 --> 00:10:53.190
I chose this.

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:54.500
There's boots, too?

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.360
Okay, we're raising her.

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:57.300
Heave!

00:10:57.740 --> 00:10:59.840
Okay, I'll undo her buttons!

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.370
I'll wipe off her sweat.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.100
Hey!

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.260
Hold her up, now!

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:08.430
I'm sorry! You're stable now!

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:09.560
So soft...

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:12.300
Don't focus on the boing-boing! We're gonna change her now!

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:13.110
Yes!

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:14.130
Pink...

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:16.460
I'm holding you up! Holding you up nice and steady!

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:17.440
I'll wipe off her sweat.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:18.910
Change her into those clothes, stat!

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:20.330
Whoa, they're tight!

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:21.650
We did it, somehow...

00:11:21.650 --> 00:11:23.240
Ooh, looks warm!

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:27.690
Hmm... We've been chased out, so what do we do?

00:11:27.690 --> 00:11:29.840
Should we peek in through the window again?

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:31.060
I guess so.

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:34.540
Time to visit those idiots with colds! Now, where's their room?

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.390
Visits call for peach cans!

00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:37.550
Says you and what army?

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:44.260
They'll become desperate like monkeys trying to get at these peach cans by eating this ice while saying "Cold, cold!"

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:47.470
You really are black to the core, Kokoro-san.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:50.940
Their colds might get worse by how cold this ice is, too!

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:55.480
But since they're stupid, they'll just be kissing my ass for bringing these peach cans!

00:11:55.910 --> 00:11:57.650
In before thunder strikes down on her.

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:59.010
Strikes her dead, hopefully.

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:00.120
Sounds good.

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:03.530
Arsène?!

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:06.850
Arsène? Did they just say Arsène?!

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:08.530
Those are the voices of Milky Holmes.

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:09.490
In that room!

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:15.010
We changed her... but we didn't have to put on the boots, did we?

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:17.110
Well, since it's a set...

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:18.930
There was a mask, too...

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:21.510
You wouldn't guess that she has a cold right now...

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:23.630
Arsène is here!

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:24.430
Yeah!

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:25.340
She's here, she's here!

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:26.370
Arrest her, arrest her!

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:45.050
Crud! Arsène-sama's identity's been discovered!

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:47.270
To think that they'd change her into that costume...

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:48.840
Now that it's come to this...

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:50.000
I'll have to strip―

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:50.580
Just stop.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:55.010
Have you recovered, Milky Holmes? Why is Arsène here?

00:12:55.010 --> 00:12:56.540
Be silent!

00:12:57.390 --> 00:13:01.000
Henriette-sama has caught a cold and is sleeping right now. Please keep quiet!

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:04.330
Eh? But isn't that Arsène lying down there?

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:06.550
Yes, we were surprised too.

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:08.210
Henriette-san...

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:09.790
...likes cosplay!

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:12.420
Really?

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:16.210
Cosplay, huh? I almost thought that was the real Arsène there!

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:17.430
High quality.

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:18.690
That was shocking, eh?

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:21.220
Right, I forgot they were retarded.

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:23.020
How is my cosplay?

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:26.110
Oh, but she has a cold, so doesn't this outfit make it worse?

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:30.930
By the way, why are you here, Kokoro-chan?

00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:31.950
Don't call me that!

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:36.230
We heard that you were moaning and groaning from the colds you'd caught, so we came to visit you!

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:38.960
Wow, peach cans!

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:42.010
I guess even student council presidents catch colds too, huh.

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:44.320
Catching it from idiots is bad taste.

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:45.340
I'm worried.

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:49.980
Her fever won't go down...

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:53.410
What's that? Cold medicine?

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:56.850
Oh, that's the one that Henriette-sama made us drink.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:14:00.870
But it looks like it's all used up... Thanks anyways, Kamaboko.

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:02.700
Empty...

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:04.240
I've remembered it!

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:04.980
What?

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:10.020
Whenever I caught colds, my grandfather would always make something that worked like a charm!

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:12.430
Well then, let's make it! What're the ingredients?

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:13.780
Yes, the ingredients are...

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:14.620
Bu...

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:15.640
Bu?

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:16.990
Bu!

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:18.330
Bu?

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:19.720
Umm, bu...

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:21.300
Stone... Mouse...

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:22.580
Sweat miso soup...

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:23.290
Green soybeans...

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:24.380
Uh, um...

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:33.730
Buddha's stone bowl?! Mount Penglai's jeweled branch?! Fire rat's skin?! Dragon ball?! Swallow's shell?! Where the hell would you find these?!

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:35.560
Yes, those are the ingredients...

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:36.490
What are those?

00:14:36.490 --> 00:14:37.520
Where are they from?

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:38.610
I think I've heard of them before.

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:40.830
You spend two hours trying to remember it, and you give us <i>these?!</i>

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:44.750
How can we get something that might not even exist in the first place?!

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:45.460
Here!

00:14:46.850 --> 00:14:54.610
"Buddha's Stone Bowl, Mount Penglai's Jeweled Branch, Fire Rat's Skin, Dragon Ball, Swallow's Shell, Kappa's Nasal Discharge..."

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:57.200
They're all here! Let's mix them right away!

00:14:57.570 --> 00:14:58.540
Okay!

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.210
Mix all of the ingredients together!

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:05.280
Keep mixing and swirling it around and around until it looks like it's ready to drink!

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:06.420
Done!

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:08.640
Is that safe?

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:10.050
It smells like death...

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:12.700
If you drink this, your cold will soon be gone!

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:14.710
Now, time to deliver the medicine.

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:16.350
Now, drink up! Drink up!

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:18.160
Eh? Huh?

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:19.150
Why won't she drink it?

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:24.850
Oh, that's what Henriette-san used to get us to drink the medicine with!

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:27.780
I see! This looks easy to drink with!

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:31.220
Here you go, your medicine.

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:37.960
Now we can relax!

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:39.540
Really?

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:45.560
I-Is this safe...?

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:49.380
Yes it is! The hair colour change and glow prove it!

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:51.660
What happens after this?

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:53.820
Oh, she should start floating any moment now.

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:55.180
Whoa, she's floating!

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:59.260
After that, her Toys will go berserk, and then she'll get better!

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:00.600
Toys going berserk?!

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:02.500
The prez's Toys will?

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:03.810
What's the prez's Toys?

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.970
Now that you mention it... I wonder what it is...

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:18.270
Everything's distorted!

00:16:21.630 --> 00:16:22.410
Pea...

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:25.630
What is it? Do you have something you want to say?

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:28.700
Peach... I want to eat a peach...

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:31.550
A peach, huh? Understood! There happens to be a can of it here―

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:37.080
Ahh, the peach can's floating away! Wait for me!

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:38.830
Please wait, peach!

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:45.700
Huh? Where is this?

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:49.200
That was dangerous!!

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:51.900
To think that a girl was born from the peach!

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:55.770
Getting a peach for the student council president, eh?

00:16:57.060 --> 00:17:00.100
Excellent. This is is a delicious peach.

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:02.550
Would you mind sharing some with me?

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:04.480
You can't have this peach.

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:05.790
But I was in it―

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.270
So does that make it your peach?

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:12.510
If you want a peach, then you'll have to go to Arsène Island!

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:15.930
It seems that Phantom Thief Arsène's stolen peaches are stockpiled there.

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:17.830
Whoa, that island looks just like them!

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:18.560
Like what?

00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:19.970
What is this child saying?

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:24.600
Anyways, I'll definitely bring back a peach for Henriette-san!

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:26.970
I'm off!

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:29.520
And now, off to Arsène Island!

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:31.690
I'm here...

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:36.200
So this is Arsène Island? Where's Arsène and the peaches?

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:37.320
Who are you?

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:41.370
It's not "who!" We're the biggie brothers!

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:43.090
It'd be best of you to turn back.

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:46.450
Biggie sister has no intention of giving you any peaches!

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:48.580
I said we're the biggie brothers, didn't I?!

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:50.040
I can't just turn back now!

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:52.350
For Henriette-san's sake, I'll...

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:55.450
I'll take the peaches!

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:05.730
Ahh, my Toys...

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:09.020
I used my Toys! Yay! Yay!

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:11.770
Dammit, you're supposed to be useless!

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:13.990
We have our own Toys too, you know!

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:16.180
My chest hair flew away!

00:18:16.180 --> 00:18:17.180
Toys of Flame!

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:18.050
Turn into a doll!

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:19.720
I'll feel you up.

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:22.410
Huh?

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:23.690
My nipples won't erect!!

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:24.860
I can't use my Toys!!

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:25.650
My...!!

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:30.640
Eh? You can't use your Toys?

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:33.880
I feel so sorry for you... What should I say to you?

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:36.130
Hey, I don't wanna hear that from you!

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:41.480
I don't understand the feelings of useless people who can't use Toys!

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:47.480
Ah, I'm sorry! I guess I really shouldn't say "useless" to useless people, eh?

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:53.270
I-Impossible! What have I done?!

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:57.920
I-I didn't do anything! This is all because of this messed up plot! The plot!!

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:02.240
Ahh! Look at me more! Yes! Can you?! Come on!

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:09.040
Arsène!

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:11.970
These are what you wanted, right?

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:16.250
I'll defeat you and get those peaches!

00:19:16.350 --> 00:19:17.920
For the sake of Henriette-san!

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:21.470
Can you really defeat me?

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:23.800
Yes, I'll defeat you!

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:26.110
Don't act so tough by yourself ~woof!

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:30.370
We've gotta stay together ~kiki!

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:32.420
I want some millet dumplings after ~chirp!

00:19:32.420 --> 00:19:33.060
Everyone!

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:35.310
Well then, everyone...

00:19:35.310 --> 00:19:37.350
I'll attack you all at once!

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:40.740
Arsène Boing-Boing Missile!

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:42.990
Boing-boing?!

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.450
The heck is that?!

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:48.010
Arsène-sama's boing-boing is...

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:51.260
My boing-boing!!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:58.460
Soft... just like... a peach...

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:02.270
It's now time to combine our Toys...

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:02.720
...into one!

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:06.050
Ninja Toys Art: Phoenix!

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:22.040
Here, Henriette-san, a peach! Please eat up!

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:36.040
They were taking care of me...

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:41.380
Though it was only in the middle of Resplendence,

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:44.620
Milky Holmes' Toys had returned to them.

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:49.720
I suppose it's safe to expect better from them after this.

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:52.140
*dejected*

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:55.810
So that was in the middle of Arsène-sama's Toys of Resplendence, huh...

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:58.020
Even then, I'm so depressed that I feel like throwing up...

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:00.480
The world is beautiful.

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:03.990
However, I am more beautiful.

00:21:06.060 --> 00:21:08.070
Thank goodness you've recovered!

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:11.930
Everyone, thank you for taking care of me.

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:14.710
Ah, but keep this a secret from everyone else, now.

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:16.780
Yes, we understand!

00:21:16.780 --> 00:21:17.670
So you like cosplay?

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:22.510
One thing's bugging me, though. What's your Toys, Henriette-san?

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:25.130
M-My Toys...?

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.740
Ahh, I wanna know too!

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:27.410
Me three!

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:28.580
Me four.

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:29.890
My...

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:35.710
Ahh, Kokoro-chan's in danger!

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:39.180
Oh, don't mind her. This is just divine punishment.

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:43.180
A truly suiting divine punishment.

00:21:43.180 --> 00:21:46.340
We're sorry for making a ruckus! She's paying the price right now!

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:22.900
Ahh, it's great that a beautiful character like Arsène-sama recovered!

00:23:22.900 --> 00:23:28.070
She's the person I love most in the world - as much as I love myself!

00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:29.740
Thoughts and being thought of - I love and hate it!

00:23:29.740 --> 00:23:31.660
No no, I love and hate it!

00:23:31.660 --> 00:23:33.880
Raw wheat, uncooked rice, raw eggs - I love and hate them!

00:23:33.880 --> 00:23:35.900
Past, present, and future - I love and hate it!

00:23:35.900 --> 00:23:39.110
Girl characters blasting off - I love and hate them!!

00:23:39.110 --> 00:23:41.710
Next time: MH's Tragedy!

00:23:41.710 --> 00:23:44.050
The culprit is me! I love it!

00:23:44.050 --> 00:23:47.520
Twenty!!!
